# EXAMPLE 1: Pipeline with a correction loop
#
# planner designs -> coder implements -> reviewer checks.
# If the reviewer writes NEEDS_FIX in its response, the work goes back to coder.
# If it writes APPROVED, the graph ends.
#
# Run:  pixelgo flow run <ws> examples/01-pipeline-review.flow "Write a CSV parser"

entry planner

node planner
node coder
node reviewer

edge planner  -> coder
edge coder    -> reviewer

# conditional edges: the decision is based on the reviewer's output
edge reviewer -> coder  when NEEDS_FIX
edge reviewer -> END    when APPROVED
